data: {"id": "6e170532294f4531-thinking-parallel_evidence-1507", "run_id": "6e170532294f4531", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的 Kubernetes、Prometheus、Logging、Tracing 和 Topology 事实，对 `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` 的分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **实体**：Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` (UID: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`)，命名空间 `aiops-case-09`，运行在 `node2`。\n*   **容器**：`app` (镜像: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)。\n*   **状态**：Phase 为 `Running`，Started 时间为 `2026-09-07T18:55:19Z`。\n*   **重启情况**：Kubernetes 事件和 Metrics 显示 `restartCount` 为 **0**。容器未发生 Crash、OOMKilled 或 CrashLoopBackOff。\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788810239530, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

