il` 模式，导致应用逻辑内部模拟“依赖不可用”并直接返回 HTTP 503 错误。\n\n*   **证据支持：** 证据 2 显示 Readiness 探针因连续 503 响应导致 Pod 被标记为 `ContainersNotReady`；证据 4 在应用日志中捕获了明确的 `dependency unavailable` 错误模式；证据 3、5、6 排除了资源限制因素。\n*   **未决事项：** 虽然日志表明“依赖不可用”，但未查明底层实际依赖组件的具体状态（unknowns），不过由于应用层是主动返回 503，底层依赖的具体状态对当前故障现象（Pod 不健康）不构成阻碍因素。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 109.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 109.0s (Evidence 97.0s, RCA 11.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 143.454, "metrics": {"run_id": "6e170532294f4531", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 143.45890974998474, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "descript